	)
	(text_box "See DS8626_STM32F407xx datasheet - \nSection 6.3.16 - I/O Port Characteristics - Table 49 - Ouptut Voltage Characteristics\nIf VDD is 3.3V and a GPIO pin is outputting 20mA, the ouptut voltage of the pin can only be as high as around 2V."
