	(text_box "NOTE: the following KiCad schematic and footprint are used in this design:\nPackage_LGA:Bosch_LGA-14_3x2.5mm_P0.5mm\nThis package is listed in the KiCad schematic library as being for the BMI160.\nI checked the pin assignments and footprint dimmensions for each sensor and feel comfortable using this schematic/footprint because they appear to match."
